        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/r/278dde/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-09-08T13:26:39.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think it hurts their ears so much that they have to spend time recovering/adjusting to the noise.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Like I imagine Ground Pound knocks villains off of their feet, and they need to spend the next round getting back up...With Hypersonic Assault, I imagine villains spending one round with their hands clasped over their ears, unable to do anything else.</p>",
